WEBVTT

00:10:27.665 --> 00:10:30.000
if not for a metaverse they can meet in.

00:10:31.043 --> 00:10:34.171
And metaverses can help amplify voices.

00:10:35.005 --> 00:10:41.011
Kids in Kosovo used the metaverse
to build their dream neighborhood area.

00:10:41.595 --> 00:10:44.556
By giving the kids millions
of virtual building blocks

00:10:44.598 --> 00:10:47.434
and endless space to build
and collaborate in,

00:10:47.434 --> 00:10:51.772
they could explore and visualize
their ideas in a fun and accessible way.

00:10:52.398 --> 00:10:56.151
Young people aren't typically
involved in planning spaces,

00:10:56.193 --> 00:10:59.697
but this time it was the kids
who were the experts.

00:10:59.738 --> 00:11:05.703
Just imagine all the joy, confidence
and creative ideas that leads to.